SUMMARY:Miller Architecture Program Virtual Information Session: Program 
 Overview + Meet the Director
DESCRIPTION:Thinking about getting your Master of Architecture at IU? Joi
 n us via Zoom to learn more about the J. Irwin Miller Master of Architect
 ure program. Each 60-minute Virtual Information Session centers around a 
 different topic\, providing information on our unique approach to archite
 cture education and how to prepare your application. Bring your questions
  to the conversation.  The J. Irwin Miller Master of Architecture program
  is a three-year in-residence program\, with advanced placement considera
 tion for students who hold a B.Arch from a NAAB Accredited institution or
  regional equivalent. With our twin studios approach\, students take visu
 al art course alongside architectural studios to develop their style of a
 rchitectural design. The three-year program welcome applicants from a var
 iety of educational and career backgrounds.ZOOM LINK:https://eskenazi.ind
 iana.edu/events/special-events/upcoming/2026-10-7-march-vis.html (https:/
 /eskenazi.indiana.edu/events/special-events/upcoming/2026-10-7-march-vis.
 html)
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p class="p1">  Thinking about getting your 
 Master of Architecture at IU? Join us via Zoom to learn more about the J.
  Irwin Miller Master of Architecture program. Each 60-minute Virtual Info
 rmation Session centers around a different topic\, providing information 
 on our unique approach to architecture education and how to prepare your 
 application. Bring your questions to the conversation.</p><p class="p1"> 
  The J. Irwin Miller Master of Architecture program is a three-year in-re
 sidence program\, with advanced placement consideration for students who 
 hold a B.Arch from a NAAB Accredited institution or regional equivalent. 
 With our twin studios approach\, students take visual art course alongsid
 e architectural studios to develop their style of architectural design. T
 he three-year program welcome applicants from a variety of educational an
 d career backgrounds.</p><p class="p1"><strong>ZOOM LINK:<br /></strong><
 a href="https://eskenazi.indiana.edu/events/special-events/upcoming/2026-
 10-7-march-vis.html">https://eskenazi.indiana.edu/events/special-events/u
 pcoming/2026-10-7-march-vis.html</a></p>
