  Talk:</strong> Friday\, September 11\, 12–1 pm\, Shreve Auditorium-Glo
 bal and International Studies Building (355 N. Eagleson Avenue)</span></p
 ><p><span data-contrast="none"><strong>Opening reception</strong>: Friday
